# Prompt
Please create an implementation of the SVIFile interface.
When creating constructor, don't make its 'data' parameter mandatory.
If not set, let attributes be undefined. In this case, they will be filled
in later.
Please use the 'path' library, don't try to write the algorithm from scratch:
getting absolute path, resolving paths, etc
This ensures working of production code and tests in various environments 
(windows, linux, mac).
constructor of SviFileClass should have no mandatory parameters

Algorithm of getSviFileRelativePath():
* Get config instance by using Config.getInstance() from ../config/config.ts
* Use function getRelativePath from ../utils/file.ts passing this.filePath and config.dir as base path